      "body": "\n<p>\n\n</p><div>\n<div>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:17a9aa8715edf559b145b9d6b25cdf421d8cde709e36817d98994fe78bcd326e\"/></div>\n<div>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:719a2bfc91abf0bdbbb239d47ffc34fb9980f15f32b3dc5224bf039bea064832\"/></div>\n<div>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:6dd27991c03f0f3ca973e2ce412d947a62cf4e4dc29230d3b36d1c28191ad483\"/></div><div>고산 지대에 사는 라라무리 부족 출신으로</div><div><br/></div><div>생애 첫 마라톤 출전이었음</div></div>\n<p></p>\n",
